Subject: [PATCH 5/8] AOSCOS: Adapt XRandR backend name declarations

Upstream-Id: 5ecc417d99198a90dbdc76d4f6f42e95423bbfdc

Remove override from the retained backend name methods because
AbstractBackend no longer declares them.

Assisted-by: gpt-6.1-sol
Signed-off-by: SignKirigami <prcups@krgm.moe>
---
 backends/xrandr/xrandr.h | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/backends/xrandr/xrandr.h b/backends/xrandr/xrandr.h
index 3c800f5..71ec40d 100644
--- a/backends/xrandr/xrandr.h
+++ b/backends/xrandr/xrandr.h
@@ -29,8 +29,8 @@ public:
     explicit XRandR();
     ~XRandR() override;
 
-    QString name() const override;
-    QString serviceName() const override;
+    QString name() const;
+    QString serviceName() const;
     KScreen::ConfigPtr config() const override;
     QFuture<KScreen::SetConfigResult> setConfig(const KScreen::ConfigPtr &config) override;
     bool isValid() const override;
